  "solution": "1. - and +\n\n192 + 16 - 18 × __**6 ÷ 24**__ = 96 \n\n⇒ 192 + 16 - __**18 × 0.25**__ = 96 \n\n⇒ __**192 + 16**__ - 4.5 = 96 \n\n⇒ __**208**____** - 4.5**__ = 96 \n\n⇒ 203.5 ≠ 96 \n\n2. - and ×\n\n__**192 × 16**__ + 18 - __**6 ÷ 24**__ = 96 \n\n⇒ __**3072**____** + 18**__ - 0.25 = 96 \n\n⇒ 3090 - 0.25 = 96 \n\n⇒ 3089.75 ≠ 96 \n\n3. - and ÷\n\n__**192 ÷ 16**__ + 18 × 6 - 24 = 96 \n\n⇒ 12 + __**18 × 6**__ - 24 = 96 \n\n⇒ 12 + 108 - 24 = 96\n\n⇒ 120 - 24 = 96\n\n⇒ 96 = 96\n\n4. × and ÷\n\n192 - 16 + __**18 ÷ 6**__ × 24 = 96 \n\n⇒ 192 - 16 + __**3**____** ×**____** 24**__ = 96 \n\n⇒ __**192**__ - 16 __**+ 72**__ = 96 \n\n⇒ __**264 - 16**__ = 96 \n\n⇒ 248 ≠ 96 \n\nHence, '-** and ÷**' is the correct answer.",
